 ~ traveller_start
Traveler: Hello, little friend! I’ve traveled to many countries and seen people from different places helping each other and working hard together. This road is called the Path of Humanity.
You: Is the Path of Humanity about saving others?
Traveler: No. You don’t need to save anyone. You just need to see, listen, and cooperate. That is the Path of Humanity.
You: I understand! I want to set off on the Path of Humanity too!
Traveler: Wonderful! Remember your mission: Observe more, listen more, help more, and do not take the lead.
=> END

~ family_start
Family: Child, we support you to explore and learn!
Player: I will do my best!
Family: Remember, respect everyone, help with small things, and bring warmth back.
Player: I will surely remember!
=> END

~ friend_start
Friend: You’re leaving! That’s so cool!
Player: When I come back, I’ll tell you all the stories along the way!
Friend: Great! I’ll wait for you!
=> END